abstract: >-
  Replication materials for Albrecht et al. (2026), "The Effect of Data
  Access on Pre-Analysis Plans: Evidence from a Many-Analyst Study on the
  Daughters Hypothesis." The package contains data-preprocessing and analysis
  code, redistributable project data and derived results, research-team
  pre-analysis plans and supplementary comments, project communications, and
  an archived snapshot of the project website. Licensed German Socio-Economic
  Panel (SOEP) microdata are not included and must be obtained separately from
  DIW Berlin.
license: CC-BY-4.0
